OL,5,G2300 MF DOOM: Long Island to Leeds
OL,6,     FAFRODEUTSCHE and Adam Batty turn
OL,7,     Fback the clock to explore the
OL,8,     Fearly life of MF DOOM, and explore
OL,9,     Fthe pop culture influences that
OL,10,     Fleft an indelible mark on him.
